Q. “How do you structure a React app?”
I follow a modular structure by separating components, pages, services, hooks, and routes. Reusable UI components go into a common folder, API logic is isolated in services, and routing is centralized. For large-scale apps, I prefer feature-based architecture to improve scalability and maintainability.

